"<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Congratulations! You have entered all the data that is necessary to create your map theme. Check the summary below carefully and press the \"Finish\" button to create the theme. </p>"
