#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, kcfg_onStartup)
#. +> trunk stable
#: src/lib/marble/MarbleNavigationSettingsWidget.ui:148
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\n"
